 and, for every database 
\begin_inset Formula $x\in\mathbb{F}^N$
\end_inset

, a polynomial 
\begin_inset Formula $f_x:\mathbb{F}^m\to\mathbb{F}$
\end_inset

 of total degree at most two satisfying 
\begin_inset Formula \begin{equation*}
f_x(v_i)=x[i],
\qquad i\in[N].
\end{equation*}
\end_inset


\end_layout

