\begin_layout Enumerate
Closure under independent products: if 
\begin_inset Formula $X\approx_cX'$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $Y\approx_cY'$
\end_inset

, and the two components are sampled independently, then 
\begin_inset Formula $(X,Y)\approx_c(X',Y')$
\end_inset

. 
