DNF and CNF Share-Size Optimization
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Consider four servers 
\begin_inset Formula $(a,b,c,d)$
\end_inset

 and the access structure in which a coalition 
\begin_inset Formula $T$
\end_inset

 is authorized exactly when 
\begin_inset Formula \begin{equation*}
|T|\geq3
\qquad\text{or}\qquad
(a\in T\text{ and }b\in T).
