\end_inset

The minimal authorized sets are 
\begin_inset Formula \begin{equation*}
(ab),\qquad(bcd),\qquad(acd).
\end{equation*}
\end_inset

The DNF construction has total share size 
\begin_inset Formula \begin{equation*}
2+3+3=8
\end{equation*}
\end_inset

field elements. 
