, the provers run in time 
\begin_inset Formula $\operatorname{poly}(T)$
\end_inset

, the verifier runs in time 
\begin_inset Formula \begin{equation*}
n\cdot\operatorname{polylog}(T),
\end{equation*}
\end_inset

and the protocol has one round, 
\begin_inset Formula $\operatorname{polylog}(T)$
\end_inset

