Low-Degree Extensions
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Let 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathbb{F}$
\end_inset

 be a field of size 
\begin_inset Formula $\operatorname{polylog}(N)$
\end_inset

, and choose 
\begin_inset Formula \begin{equation*}
\{0,1\}\subseteq H\subset\mathbb{F},
\qquad |H|=\log N.
\end{equation*}
\end_inset

Let 
\begin_inset Formula $m$
\end_inset

 satisfy 
