|H|^m=N.
\end{equation*}
\end_inset

Identify the indexes in 
\begin_inset Formula $[N]$
\end_inset

 with elements of 
\begin_inset Formula $H^m$
\end_inset

, and view an assignment as a function 
\begin_inset Formula \begin{equation*}
