\begin_inset Formula $i\in[\ell]$
\end_inset

, set 
\begin_inset Formula \begin{multline*}
Q_i(z_1,\ldots,z_\ell)
=\sum_{h\in H}L_h(z_i)\cdot\\
Q_{i-1}(z_1,\ldots,z_{i-1},h,z_{i+1},\ldots,z_\ell).
\end{multline*}
\end_inset

The proof contains the truth tables of 
\begin_inset Formula \begin{equation*}
Q_0,\ldots,Q_\ell.
\end{equation*}
\end_inset

The polynomial 
\begin_inset Formula $Q_\ell$
\end_inset

 is the LDE of 
\begin_inset Formula $Q$
\end_inset

.
